   <text:p text:style-name="P436">Figure <text:sequence text:ref-name="refFigure5" text:name="Figure" text:formula="ooow:Figure+1" style:num-format="1">6</text:sequence>: <text:s/>3 word input message with <text:span text:style-name="T589">delays on both sides</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P96">The following diagram shows an input port where only the worker responds one cycle after it sees new input, resulting in a throughput of 2 clock cycles per data word.</text:p>
