   <text:p text:style-name="P437">Figure <text:sequence text:ref-name="refFigure6" text:name="Figure" text:formula="ooow:Figure+1" style:num-format="1">7</text:sequence>: <text:s/>3 word input message width worker adding delay</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P96">The following diagram shows an input port where both sides respond in the same cycle, with no delays, resulting in a throughput of 1 clock cycles per data word.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Diagram"><text:soft-page-break/><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr2" draw:name="Image3" text:anchor-type="as-char" svg:width="5.3244in" svg:height="2.8839in" draw:z-index="6"><draw:image>
